{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"stand and deliver\" escalante (+ future futures college career dream dreams))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#7_1878652119","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2126","rank":1,"snippet":"3908.000000 , \"headings\": \"Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies Obituaries Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies Students 'Stand And Deliver' For Former Teacher 'Barrio Kids' Web Resources After-Hours Tutoring Giving Back To 'Kimo' Fund public radio's future \" , \"segment\": \"In this scene, Escalante shows up at a family restaurant owned by the parents of one of his brightest students, Ana. Her father had pulled her out of Escalante's calculus class so that she could work more hours at the restaurant. Escalante tries to change his mind. (SOUNDBITE OF MOVIE, \\\"<cover>STAND AND DELIVER\") JAMES OLMOS: ( as Jaime Escalante) Ana can be the first one in your family to graduate from high school, go to college. </cover>JAMES VICTOR: ( as Mr. Delgado) Thank you for your concern. Her mother works here, her sisters, her brothers. This is a family business. She's needed.\" , \"start_char\": 3332.000000 , \"title\": \"Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies : NPR\" , \"url\": \"https://www.npr.org/templates/story/story.php?storyId=125380015\" }"}}
