{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" (+ dream dreams dreaming) students (+ college future success))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1595169849#1_3557777191","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2133","rank":1,"snippet":"18 Inspiring Quotes About Education And Success Quotes About Education And Success Posted by Shirley Malinowski \" , \"segment\": \"Malcolm Forbes “Education is the key to success in life, and teachers make a lasting impact in the lives of their <cover>students.” — Solomon Ortiz “Education is the most powerful weapon which you can use to change the world.” — Nelson Mandela “Education is the ticket to success.” — Jaime Escalante “Creativity is the key to success in the future, and primary education is where teachers can bring creativity in children at that level.” — A. P. J. Abdul Kalam “Education is the movement from darkness to light.” — Allan Bloom “Success is a lousy teacher. It seduces smart people into thinking they can’t lose.” — Bill Gates “Encouragement of higher education for our youth is critical to the success of our collective future.” — Charles B. Rangel “A great career without great education is only a dream, </cover>we are nothing but just helping you to realize your dreams, smart success” — Unknown “Success is not defined by status, money, education, career or another person but rather by the level of peace that I have within myself.” — Liza Lugo “The economy is the start "}}
