{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" \"education is the ticket to success\" students)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1595169849#0_3557775535","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2134","rank":1,"snippet":"And Success 4 years ago 7 months ago Inspiration , Quotes , Success 18 Inspiring Quotes About Education And Success by Shirley Malinowski Following are the best collection of Inspiring quotes about education and success. Quotes About Education And Success “Formal education will make you a living; self-education will make you a fortune.” — Jim Rohn “Your positive action combined with positive thinking results in success.” — Shiv Khera “Failure is success if we learn from it.” — Malcolm Forbes “Education is the key to success in life, and teachers make a lasting impact in the lives of their <cover>students.” — Solomon Ortiz “Education is the most powerful weapon which you can use to change the world.” — Nelson Mandela “Education is the ticket to success.” — Jaime Escalante “</cover>Creativity is the key to success in the future, and primary education is where teachers can bring creativity in children at that level.” — A. P. J. Abdul Kalam “Education is the movement from darkness to light.” —\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"18 Inspiring Quotes About Education And Success\" , \"url\": \"https://www.centralofsuccess.com/quotes-about-education-and-success/\" }"}}
