{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" \"barrio kids\" (+ college future success possibility))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#1_1878645056","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2138","rank":3,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#1_1878645056\" , \"end_char\": 1956.000000 , \"headings\": \"Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies Obituaries Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies Students 'Stand And Deliver' For Former Teacher '<cover>Barrio Kids' Web Resources After-Hours Tutoring Giving Back To 'Kimo' Fund public radio's future \" , \"segment\": \"Jaime Escalante </cover>was 79. His inspiring story gained fame in the 1988 film Stand and Deliver but in later years he struggled to duplicate his earlier successes. MARY LOUISE KELLY, Host: The Bolivian-born math teacher was the subject of the 1988 hit film \"Stand and Deliver,\" which showcased his story and his gift for teaching. Escalante died yesterday after a long battle with cancer. He was 79. NPR's Claudio Sanchez has this appreciation. JAIME ESCALANTE: My assignment, it was not just to teach mathematics. It was to teach discipline and responsibility.\" , \"start_char\": 1400.000000 , \"title\": \"Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies : NPR\" , \"url\":","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#14_1878661556","rank":1,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#15_1878663180","rank":2,"relevance":3}]}}
