{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_586753098#15_1198891641","relevance":1,"reason":"The passage is about Escalante's arrival at Garfield High and the difficult classroom context, but it does not explain how he encouraged students to envision their futures.","learned":"The Encyclopedia.com segments continue to provide background about Garfield and Escalante's math assignment rather than direct future-oriented encouragement."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" students (+ \"career aspirations\" \"educational aspirations\" \"lifelong\" \"future aspirations\"))","reason":"Search for more explicit language about Escalante influencing students' aspirations, which may yield direct evidence about encouraging them to imagine futures in education or careers."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" students (+ \"career aspirations\" \"educational aspirations\" \"lifelong\" \"future aspirations\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_345449932#0_824515965","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2150","rank":1,"snippet":"experienced and understand on a personal level. If we were particularly fortunate, we had numerous exceptional teachers who made school an exciting and interesting place. Those teachers possessed a passion for the subjects that they taught and genuine care for the students with whom they worked. They inspired us to play with ideas, think deeply about the subject matter, take on more challenging work, and even pursue careers in a particular field of study. Some exceptional teachers achieve celebrity status, such as <cover>Jaime Escalante, the math teacher who inspired the film Stand and Deliver, but thousands of unsung heroes go unrecognized in their remarkable work with students on a daily basis. Qualities of Effective Teachers We know intuitively that these highly effective teachers can have an enriching effect on the daily lives of children and their lifelong </cover>educational and career aspirations.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"The Power of an Effective Teacher and Why We Should Assess It\" , \"url\": \"http://www.ascd.org/publications/books/104136/chapters/The-Power-of-an-Effective-Teacher-and-Why-We-Should-Assess-It.aspx\" }"}}
