{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_135588563#4_314717466","relevance":2,"reason":"The passage is a kid-friendly role-model profile of Jaime Escalante and says he inspired, encouraged, and motivated poor students to take and pass AP Calculus despite cynics. It supports his motivational effect, but it does not directly explain how he helped students envision specific futures such as college or careers.","learned":"Some role-model profiles summarize Escalante's encouragement as motivating poor students to attempt and pass AP Calculus despite others' doubts."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante on being a teacher\" students (+ future college career success))","reason":"The latest result points to an interview/video titled 'Jaime Escalante On Being A Teacher'; searching that title with future-oriented terms may uncover Escalante's own explanation of how he encouraged students' ambitions."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante on being a teacher\" students (+ future college career success))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_135588563#3_314715755","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2154","rank":3,"snippet":"More videos Switch camera Share Include playlist An error occurred while retrieving sharing information. Please try again later. Watch on 0:00 0:00 0:00 / 1:01 Live • 2. Jaime Escalante: Teacher Jaime Escalante was born to two teachers of Aymara ancestry in Bolivia, and taught math and physics. When he immigrated to the US he taught himself English and went to <cover>college. Jaime Escalante is well known for teaching Calculus at an under-performing school in Los Angeles. He inspired and encouraged and motivated poor students at record numbers to take and pass the AP Calculus class, despite many cynics who didn’t believe in him. Read this kid-friendly biography of Jaime Escalante and check out this video where he is interviewed: YouTube thefutureschannel 328 subscribers Subscribe Jaime Escalante On Being A Teacher</cover>Watch later Copy link Info Shopping Tap to unmute If playback doesn't begin shortly, try restarting your device.\" , \"start_char\": 1639.000000 , \"title\": \"5 Famous Latinos for Kids: Hispanic Heritage Month\" , \"url\": \"https://kidworldcitizen.org/5-famous-latinos-role-models-for-hispanic-heritage-month/\"","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#14_1878661556","rank":1,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#15_1878663180","rank":2,"relevance":3}]}}
