{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"jaime escalante\" kimo students (+ college careers future success))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#2_1878646136","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2157","rank":3,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#2_1878646136\" , \"end_char\": 2385.000000 , \"headings\": \"Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies Obituaries Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies<cover>Students 'Stand And Deliver' For Former Teacher 'Barrio Kids' Web Resources After-Hours Tutoring Giving Back To 'Kimo' Fund public radio's future \" , \"segment\": \"He was 79. NPR's Claudio Sanchez has this appreciation. JAIME ESCALANTE: </cover>My assignment, it was not just to teach mathematics. It was to teach discipline and responsibility. CLAUDIO SANCHEZ: For 20 years, the Bolivian-born Escalante taught calculus and advanced math at Garfield High School in one of east L.A.'s most notorious barrios, a place where poor, hardened street kids were not supposed to master mathematics - certainly not algebra, trigonometry, calculus. But Escalante believed that a teacher should never, ever let a student give up. So I asked him what kept you from giving up. ESCALANTE:\" , \"start_char\": 1784.000000 , \"title\": \"Teacher Portrayed in 'Stand And Deliver' Dies : NPR","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#14_1878661556","rank":1,"relevance":1},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1039848851#1_1878645056","rank":2,"relevance":2}]}}
